# item30: Plage01 route, walked end to end. No teleports except the killer and truck-door
# ones, which are replaced segment by segment (see local/reports/item30-plage01-walk.md).
#
# Steps 1-2 (this file): the hut AND the beach/back-route walk to TouchTrigger8 are fully
# walked. The TouchTrigger7 teleport lands on the trigger after the detour (it fires the
# game's own killer chain); the killer and truck-door teleports keep their roles, re-timed to
# after the walk.

