# ---- TouchTrigger7, the killer and the truck door: still teleported in this step ----------
# The T8 chain (the killer scene) holds the player controller ~13 s (firing inside it defers
# Pawn.AdjustAim, measured; a T7 teleport 0.5 s into the scene wedged the handback for the
# rest of the run). Touching T7 after the scene ends (v6: 12.6 s) keeps the chain healthy.
t=322.00 teleport 1093.0 -13854.0 1113.0

# Diagnostic weapon bootstrap; the actual fire/death/inventory transfer are the game's code.
# The cliff-vignette chain (dispatcher_tueur_falaise1/2, tueur_rampe) drops the player
# controller from the executed scope at t~157; firing inside the held window defers
# Pawn.AdjustAim, and the control return lands 3-4 s after the LAST deferred fire across
# nine measured runs. Spaced probe fires therefore walk the hold to its end (any probe that
# lands also damages the killer); the kill burst follows past the longest observed hold.
t=330.00 weapon XIII.m60
